      <div class="services-grid">
        <div class="service-card">
          <h3>Wall Sawing</h3>
          <p>Precision wall sawing for openings, windows, and doors with minimal disruption to surrounding structures.</p>
          <div class="service-specs">
            <h4>Equipment Specifications:</h4>
            <ul class="specs-list">
              <li><strong>Cutting Depth:</strong> Up to 36 inches thick</li>
              <li><strong>Power Range:</strong> 40-65 HP</li>
              <li><strong>Blade Diameter:</strong> Up to 60 inches</li>
              <li><strong>Applications:</strong> Window openings, door openings, structural modifications</li>
              <li><strong>Features:</strong> Hydraulic positioning, dust suppression, precision cutting</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="service-card">
          <h3>Core Drilling</h3>
          <p>Accurate core drilling for utilities, HVAC, and plumbing installations with precision depth control.</p>
          <div class="service-specs">
            <h4>Equipment Specifications:</h4>
            <ul class="specs-list">
              <li><strong>Hole Diameter:</strong> 1/2 inch to 28 inches</li>
              <li><strong>Drilling Depth:</strong> Any depth</li>
              <li><strong>Power Range:</strong> 15-40 HP</li>
              <li><strong>Applications:</strong> Electrical conduits, plumbing pipes, HVAC ducts</li>
              <li><strong>Features:</strong> Water-cooled drilling, precise positioning, minimal vibration</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="service-card">
          <h3>Flat Sawing</h3>
          <p>Professional flat sawing for concrete surface preparation, roadwork, and parking lot projects with precision cutting capabilities.</p>
          <div class="service-specs">
            <h4>Equipment Specifications:</h4>
            <ul class="specs-list">
              <li><strong>Cutting Depth:</strong> Up to 25 inches thick</li>
              <li><strong>Power Range:</strong> 47-72 HP</li>
              <li><strong>Blade Diameter:</strong> Up to 48 inches</li>
              <li><strong>Applications:</strong> Concrete slabs, driveways, sidewalks, parking lots</li>
              <li><strong>Features:</strong> Dust control systems, precision depth control</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="service-card">
          <h3>Concrete Breaking</h3>
          <p>Controlled concrete breaking and hauling services for demolition projects with minimal environmental impact.</p>
          <div class="service-specs">
            <h4>Equipment Specifications:</h4>
            <ul class="specs-list">
              <li><strong>Breaking Capacity:</strong> Up to 24 inches thick</li>
              <li><strong>Equipment Type:</strong> Hydraulic breakers, excavators</li>
              <li><strong>Power Range:</strong> 25-75 HP</li>
              <li><strong>Applications:</strong> Foundation removal, slab demolition, structural demolition</li>
              <li><strong>Features:</strong> Controlled demolition, dust suppression, debris removal</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="service-card">
          <h3>Chain Saw Cutting</h3>
          <p>Heavy-duty chain saw cutting for thick concrete and challenging applications where precision is critical.</p>
          <div class="service-specs">
            <h4>Equipment Specifications:</h4>
            <ul class="specs-list">
              <li><strong>Cutting Depth:</strong> Up to 30 inches thick</li>
              <li><strong>Power Range:</strong> 35-55 HP</li>
              <li><strong>Chain Length:</strong> Up to 48 inches</li>
              <li><strong>Applications:</strong> Thick walls, bridge decks, heavy concrete structures</li>
              <li><strong>Features:</strong> Diamond-tipped chains, water cooling, precision control</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
